<title>UK: Scottish Hydro H1 pretax profit edges lower.</title>
<headline>Scottish Hydro H1 pretax profit edges lower.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.37		  vs 11.85</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.28		   vs 4.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     61.3		   vs 61.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   416.8		  vs 388.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 63.0 and 70.7 million stg. Full company name - Scottish Hydro-Electric Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
